      "content": "wait, you said angina too? that sounds scary. i'm 58 so i guess i shouldn't ignore it, but it really feels exactly like the heartburn i get after eating spicy food. i don't really want to go to the ER or anything if i can help it, it's a hassle. if i just take a couple more of those antacids right now, is that enough to settle it down? i just want to get through the day without feeling like this.",
